{"hymn":"S357","parent":"E471","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¿Cómo podré quedarme atrás","subtitle":"Consagración—Regresar al Señor","syl":{"n1":["¿Có","i"],"n2":["mo","t"],"n3":["po","i"],"n4":["dré","t"],"n5":["que","i"],"n6":["dar","m"],"n7":["me‿a","m"],"n8":["trás?","t"],"n9":"Y","n10":["con","i"],"n11":["tris","m"],"n12":["tar","t"],"n13":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n14":["pí","m"],"n15":["ri","m"],"n16":["tu,","t"],"n17":["Si‿es","i"],"n18":["pe","m"],"n19":["ras","t"],"n20":"Tú","n21":"por","n22":"mí?","n23":["Es","i"],"n24":["toy","t"],"n25":["dis","i"],"n26":["pues","m"],"n27":["to‿a","t"],"n28":["re","i"],"n29":["gre","m"],"n30":["sar;","t"],"n31":"No","n33":["quie","i"],"n34":["ro","t"],"n35":"yo","n36":"más","n37":["de","i"],"n38":["mo","m"],"n39":["rar,","t"],"n40":["Si","i"],"n41":["no","t"],"n42":["se","i"],"n43":["guir","m"],"n44":["te‿a","t"],"n45":"Ti."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Hoy sin reservas yo te doy","Lo que poseo‿y lo que soy","Para cumplir Tu plan.","¡Oh, que lo‿aceptes, mi Señor!","Que sólo busque hacer yo","Padre, Tu voluntad."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Mirando atrás, dolor sentí:","Jamás yo traje‿un alma‿a Ti,","Tu palabra‿escondí.","Oh, que‿el Señor Su‿unción me dé","Y que Él viva en mi ser","Para yo‿hablar de Él."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Me dio Su gracia‿en Su bondad,","Pues, más que‿amigo,‿en realidad","Su novia anhelo ser.","Su vida quiero expresar,","Tomar Su cruz sin vacilar","Y uno ser con Él."]}]}